Z||000007||Racer 1||06-29-99||10:59 AM||||Hey pretender what engine do you have 2.5 or 2.8?I had similiar problems with my 2.5.I took the TBI carb of and noticed black hard carbon buildup between the carb and gasket clearout all path with carb cleaner and small screwdriver.Your idle air control valve pathway might be block.Now on my car the throttle position sensor was bad causing high idle also.And check for intake manifold to engine leaks also! Good Luck
